  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>The angular speed&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>&#969;</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;of the child can be calculated as follows:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnspacing=\"0px\" columnalign=\"right center left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>&#969;</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd/><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>rad</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>The formula to calculate the centrifugal force on the child is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>r</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>Substitute the values of the known parameters into equation (1) to calculate the required centrifugal force.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnspacing=\"0px\" columnalign=\"right center left\"><mtr><mtd><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>rad</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd/><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mn>40</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p></blockquote>",
